  "label": "Online Shaming",
  "description": "Online shaming is the act of publicly criticizing or humiliating someone through digital media, often via social media or internet forums. The meme’s intent to blame and insult the creator of the image falls under this category. The visual of multiple hands pointing at the woman amplifies the sense of being targeted, which is a common trope in online shaming culture.",
